And finally, using the situation as a catalyst.

450
00:23:42,140 --> 00:23:49,590
Reviewing overall retention strategies, conducting exit interviews to understand why someone laughed, that can help prevent future resignations.

451
00:23:50,170 --> 00:23:50,810
Learning from it.

452
00:23:50,990 --> 00:23:53,040
You're turning a negative into a learning opportunity.

453
00:23:53,120 --> 00:23:53,520
Hopefully.

